  "NW2": {
    "query_id": "NW2",
    "question": "What is the total revenue per product category, and which category generates the most revenue?",
    "status": "success",
    "final_answer_text": "The total revenue per product category is as follows:\n\n1. **Beverages**: $267,868.18\n2. **Dairy Products**: $234,507.28\n3. **Confections**: $167,357.23\n4. **Meat/Poultry**: $163,022.36\n5. **Seafood**: $131,261.74\n6. **Condiments**: $106,047.08\n7. **Produce**: $99,984.58\n8. **Grains/Cereals**: $95,744.59\n\nThe category that generates the most revenue is **Beverages**.",
    "sql_generated": [
      "SELECT c.category_name, SUM(od.unit_price * od.quantity * (1 - od.discount)) AS total_revenue\nFROM public.order_details od\nJOIN public.products p ON od.product_id = p.product_id\nJOIN public.categories c ON p.category_id = c.category_id\nGROUP BY c.category_name\nORDER BY total_revenue DESC"
    ],
    "sql_executed": [
